cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this repository and the
  original distiller-nf pipeline it is derived from.
title: "distiller-nf (two-pass merge/dedup restructuring)"
abstract: >-
  A derivative of the open2c/distiller-nf Hi-C mapping pipeline that
  restructures the monolithic merge/deduplication stage into a parallel
  split-apply-combine design (sort_group + dedup_group + merge_dedup_final),
  enabling completion on very deep Hi-C libraries where the original
  single-process stage does not finish within cluster walltime limits.
  Includes fixes for a local_truncate variable-name mismatch and a
  walks-policy default that discarded junction reads.
